As a Web UI developer in TourTrip.app:

## Core Standards
- **TypeScript**: Strict mode enabled; ESLint + Prettier; small, composable, testable components.
- **Next.js**: App Router architecture; Server Components default; React 18 concurrent features.
- **UI Framework**: Tailwind CSS + Radix UI + shadcn/ui; responsive design; theme system (light/dark/auto).
- **State Management**: Server-first approach; minimal client state; TanStack Query for remote data.

## TourTrip.app Web Features
- **Progressive Web App**: Service worker; offline support; installable; push notifications.
- **Tour Discovery**: Advanced search/filtering; map integration; image galleries; virtual tours.
- **Booking Flow**: Multi-step forms; payment integration; confirmation flows; booking management.
- **User Dashboard**: Trip planning; booking history; saved tours; travel documents.
- **Real-time Features**: Live chat support; booking status updates; travel notifications.

## Performance & Core Web Vitals
- **Loading Performance**: Code splitting; lazy loading; optimized images; CDN delivery.
- **Runtime Performance**: Avoid layout shifts; optimize rendering; efficient re-renders.
- **Accessibility**: WCAG 2.1 AA compliance; keyboard navigation; screen reader support.
- **SEO**: Server-side rendering; meta tags; structured data; sitemap generation.

## Security Implementation
- **Content Security Policy**: Strict CSP headers; no inline scripts; nonce-based exceptions.
- **Input Sanitization**: XSS prevention; HTML encoding; user-generated content filtering.
- **Authentication**: Secure session handling; CSRF protection; secure cookie configuration.
- **API Security**: Request signing; rate limiting; input validation on client and server.

## Forms & User Input
- **Form Library**: react-hook-form with Zod validation; type-safe forms; field-level errors.
- **Validation**: Client-side for UX; server-side for security; real-time feedback.
- **File Uploads**: Progress indicators; drag-and-drop; image compression; security scanning.
- **Optimistic Updates**: Immediate UI feedback; error rollback; conflict resolution.

## Testing Strategy
- **Unit Testing**: Vitest + Testing Library; component testing; utility function testing.
- **Integration Testing**: API integration; form submission flows; user journey testing.
- **E2E Testing**: Playwright for critical paths; booking flow; payment processing.
- **Accessibility Testing**: axe-core integration; manual keyboard testing; screen reader validation.

## Mobile-First Responsive Design
- **Breakpoints**: Mobile-first approach; tablet and desktop enhancements.
- **Touch Interactions**: Proper touch targets; gesture support; swipe navigation.
- **Performance**: Mobile performance budgets; lazy loading; efficient bundling.
- **Offline Support**: Service worker caching; offline pages; data synchronization.

## Self-Check Protocol (Web)
Before deploying:
- [ ] Lighthouse score ≥90 (Performance, Accessibility, Best Practices, SEO)
- [ ] No console errors or warnings in production build
- [ ] All forms validate on both client and server
- [ ] Responsive design tested across device sizes
- [ ] Keyboard navigation works for all interactive elements
- [ ] Images optimized and properly sized for different viewports
- [ ] CSP headers configured without unsafe-inline
- [ ] Bundle size within budget (<250KB initial load)

## Soft Blocks (Web)
REJECT these patterns and suggest secure alternatives:
- ❌ Using dangerouslySetInnerHTML without proper sanitization
- ❌ Inline styles or scripts that violate CSP
- ❌ Client-side storage of sensitive data (tokens, PII)
- ❌ Large bundle sizes without lazy loading
- ❌ Missing loading and error states for async operations
- ❌ Form submissions without proper validation and CSRF protection

## Component Architecture Patterns
```tsx
// Preferred: Server Component with client interaction
import { Suspense } from 'react';
import { TourSearchClient } from './tour-search-client';
import { TourSearchSkeleton } from './tour-search-skeleton';

export default async function TourSearchPage({
  searchParams
}: {
  searchParams: { location?: string; date?: string; guests?: string }
}) {
  return (
    <div className="container mx-auto px-4 py-8">
      <h1 className="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">Find Your Perfect Tour</h1>
      <Suspense fallback={<TourSearchSkeleton />}>
        <TourSearchResults initialParams={searchParams} />
      </Suspense>
    </div>
  );
}

// Client Component for interactive features
'use client';

import { useSearchParams } from 'next/navigation';
import { useQuery } from '@tanstack/react-query';
import { z } from 'zod';

const SearchParamsSchema = z.object({
  location: z.string().optional(),
  date: z.string().datetime().optional(),
  guests: z.coerce.number().min(1).max(20).optional()
});

export function TourSearchClient() {
  const searchParams = useSearchParams();
  const params = SearchParamsSchema.parse(Object.fromEntries(searchParams));
  
  const { data, isLoading, error } = useQuery({
    queryKey: ['tours', params],
    queryFn: () => searchTours(params),
    staleTime: 5 * 60 * 1000, // 5 minutes
  });

  if (error) {
    return <ErrorBoundary error={error} reset={() => window.location.reload()} />;
  }

  return (
    <div className="space-y-6">
      <SearchFilters />
      {isLoading ? (
        <TourGridSkeleton />
      ) : (
        <TourGrid tours={data?.tours} />
      )}
    </div>
  );
}
```

## Performance Optimization
- **Image Optimization**: Next.js Image component; WebP/AVIF formats; responsive sizing.
- **Bundle Optimization**: Tree shaking; dynamic imports; vendor chunking; gzip compression.
- **Caching Strategy**: Static generation; ISR; client-side caching; CDN configuration.
- **Runtime Optimization**: React.memo; useMemo/useCallback; virtual scrolling for large lists.

## Internationalization & Localization
- **i18n Framework**: next-intl or react-i18next; locale routing; fallback languages.
- **Content Management**: Translation files; plural forms; number/date formatting.
- **RTL Support**: Bidirectional text; layout mirroring; proper font selection.
- **Cultural Adaptation**: Local payment methods; currency display; date/time formats.